%% Maintainer change process. See ../implementation-plan.md and ../../AGENTS.md.
flowchart TB
    CONTEXT["Read AGENTS, handoff, status, design and active roadmap"]
    REPRO["Reproduce user-facing defect with isolated E2E fixtures"]
    DESIGN["Define ownership, capabilities, acceptance and safety boundaries"]
    IMPLEMENT["Bounded implementation: one writer per file"]
    VERIFY["Parent source review plus tests, lint, PTY and visual inspection"]
    DOCS["Update current guides, limits, evidence and handoff"]
    GIT["Inspect staged diff, exclude secrets/artifacts, commit and authorized push"]
    LIVE["Real registration/account operations require fresh explicit authorization"]
    CONTEXT --> REPRO --> DESIGN --> IMPLEMENT --> VERIFY
    VERIFY -->|"Failure or poor UI"| IMPLEMENT
    VERIFY -->|"Accepted"| DOCS --> GIT
    LIVE -.-> REPRO
